  "notes": "LRCGET lyrics manager. Hot pink (#f35697) is the single brand accent: primary buttons (Download all lyrics, Synced, Sync word), scrubber thumb/track, play button. Timestamps are monospace pills colored by role — pink-tinted start times, amber-tinted end times — and green dots mark synced lines. Active line row is gray with sync/nudge (◂◂ ▸▸) controls; a pink 'built' marker label sits under the word strip to show the current word being synced. Save is a split button (disabled until edits) whose chevron opens a popover with 'Save and publish' to LRCLIB and export-to-directory checkboxes (verified live, closed in capture). Proposed new codebook entry timed-text-sync-editor for this lyrics timing editor. Rows in the background table carry status pills: Synced, Word Synced, Instrumental."
